{"content":{"result":[{"rank_order":1,"title":"Api-Eks-2017-11-01","context":"### InsightsFilter\n\n##### Description\n\nThe criteria to use for the insights.\n\n##### Members\n\n**categories**\n: : **Type:** *Array of strings*\n\n The categories to use to filter insights. The following lists the available categories:\n\n * `UPGRADE_READINESS`: Amazon EKS identifies issues that could impact your ability to upgrade to new versions of Kubernetes. These are called upgrade insights.\n * `MISCONFIGURATION`: Amazon EKS identifies misconfiguration in your EKS Hybrid Nodes setup that could impair functionality of your cluster or workloads. These are called configuration insights.\n\n**kubernetesVersions**\n: : **Type:** *Array of strings*\n\n The Kubernetes versions to use to filter the insights.\n\n**statuses**\n: : **Type:** *Array of strings*\n\n The statuses to use to filter the insights","url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/aws-sdk-php/v3/api/api-eks-2017-11-01.html"},{"rank_order":2,"title":"InsightsFilter","context":"## Contents\n\n**categories**\n: The categories to use to filter insights. The following lists the available categories:\n\n * `UPGRADE_READINESS`: Amazon EKS identifies issues that could impact your\n ability to upgrade to new versions of Kubernetes. These are called upgrade insights.\n * `MISCONFIGURATION`: Amazon EKS identifies misconfiguration in your EKS\n Hybrid Nodes setup that could impair functionality of your cluster or\n workloads. These are called configuration insights.\n\n Type: Array of strings\n\n Valid Values: `UPGRADE_READINESS | MISCONFIGURATION | ROLLBACK_READINESS`\n\n Required: No\n\n**kubernetesVersions**\n: The Kubernetes versions to use to filter the insights.\n\n Type: Array of strings\n\n Required: No\n\n**statuses**\n: The statuses to use to filter the insights.\n\n Type: Array of strings\n\n Valid Values: `PASSING | WARNING | ERROR | UNKNOWN`\n\n Required: No","url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/eks/latest/APIReference/API_InsightsFilter.html"},{"rank_order":3,"title":"Class: Aws::EKS::Types::InsightsFilter\n \n — AWS SDK for Ruby V3","context":"## Instance Attribute Details\n\n### #**categories** ⇒ Array<String>\n\nThe categories to use to filter insights. The following lists the\navailable categories:\n\n* `UPGRADE_READINESS`: Amazon EKS identifies issues that could\n impact your ability to upgrade to new versions of Kubernetes.\n These are called upgrade insights.\n* `MISCONFIGURATION`: Amazon EKS identifies misconfiguration in your\n EKS Hybrid Nodes setup that could impair functionality of your\n cluster or workloads. These are called configuration insights.\n\nReturns:\n\n* (Array<String>)\n\n| | |\n| --- | --- |\n| ``` 5429 5430 5431 5432 5433 5434 5435 ``` | ``` # File 'gems/aws-sdk-eks/lib/aws-sdk-eks/types.rb', line 5429 class InsightsFilter < Struct.new( :categories, :kubernetes_versions, :statuses) SENSITIVE = [] include Aws::Structure end ``` |\n\n### #**kubernetes_versions** ⇒ Array<String>\n\nThe Kubernetes versions to use to filter the insights.\n\nReturns:\n\n* (Array<String>)\n\n| | |\n| --- | --- |\n| ``` 5429 5430 5431 5432 5433 5434 5435 ``` | ``` # File 'gems/aws-sdk-eks/lib/aws-sdk-eks/types.rb', line 5429 class InsightsFilter < Struct.new( :categories, :kubernetes_versions, :statuses) SENSITIVE = [] include Aws::Structure end ``` |\n\n### #**statuses** ⇒ Array<String>\n\nThe statuses to use to filter the insights.\n\nReturns:\n\n* (Array<String>)\n\n| | |\n| --- | --- |\n| ``` 5429 5430 5431 5432 5433 5434 5435 ``` | ``` # File 'gems/aws-sdk-eks/lib/aws-sdk-eks/types.rb', line 5429 class InsightsFilter < Struct.new( :categories, :kubernetes_versions, :statuses) SENSITIVE = [] include Aws::Structure end ``` |\n\nGenerated on Mon Oct 26 18:34:57 2026 by\nyard\n0.9.45 (ruby-3.4.3)","url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-ruby/v3/api/Aws/EKS/Types/InsightsFilter.html"}]}}

